WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.012
That was the old model.

00:00:02.012 --> 00:00:05.726
Officials behind a screen, waiting for instructions.

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:07.410
Today, the new command.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:13.811
Active people integrating their knowledge into the solution and coordinating resources from the command post.

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:20.371
GusCoordina articulates institutions in real time.

00:00:20.371 --> 00:00:25.415
Six specialized agents per incident, with reports and permanent traceability.

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:28.486
Everyone is notified instantly. Information is handled and articulated permanently, in daily operations and in crisis.

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:33.878
La información se trata y se articula de forma permanente, en operación diaria y en crisis.
